9993-246f-4d95-ae18-af9cbb1c11b7" facs="#m-50f17691-a6e8-4028-8c91-e2cec2e86fad" label="lyrics-like">rem meum. f Confitébor nómini meum a perditióne.</l><l xml:id="m-0b445f43-ae64-456c-978a-9e9cb2940c85" facs="#m-63d3c0eb-869c-4782-9acc-5407dc03c745" label="text-like">For a Holy Woman, not a Martyr. Chapter. Prov. 3r. b.</l><l xml:id="m-3efa83c9-7d24-442a-8ddc-afdd3c420fed" facs="#m-e71be02c-2b83-4a70-a4e3-27b074292666" label="lyrics-like">Ulierem fortem quis invéniet? prétium ejus. t Confidit in ea cor</l><l xml:id="m-ba3b3944-0b92-40a1-bdd9-0532a0df9c7e" facs="#m-038fb450-b01c-44d0-8615-349289eeb27a" label="lyrics-like">J1C procul, et de ústimis finibus ! viri sui, * et spóliis non indigébit</l></lg>
